<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Thank you for writing to us.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><i><font size="2">-If unhappy with allocation add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" style="">I regret your disappointment with seating allocation on your flight to <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.Arrival_City__c}</span>&nbsp;on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}. Seating allocation for our flights is open on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en.html" target="_blank">qantas.com</a>&nbsp;from 350 days prior to each flight departure. This means if customers wait until check in, there are often limited seats left for allocation. </font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><i><font size="2">-If split seating add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">I regret we were unable to seat you and your <b><i>-wife/family/son etc</i>- </b>next to each other on your flight to {!Case.Arrival_City__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Seating allocation for our flights is open on <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en.html" target="_blank">qantas.com</a>, from 350 days prior to each flight departure. This means if customers wait until they arrive at the airport to request their seats it can be difficult for our check-in staff to provide multiple seats together, especially where the flight is full.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><i><font size="2">-If not provided pre-selected seat add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" style="">I regret we were unable to provide you the seat requested on your flight to <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.Arrival_City__c}</span> on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}. While we try to meet every customer’s seating preference, even when you have a pre-allocated seat, we sometimes need to rearrange seating for security or operational reasons. We do our best to re-book you to a seat similar to the one you held.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><i><font size="2">-If not provided FF profile preference add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" style="">I regret we were unable to allocate a seat matching the preference listed in your Frequent Flyer profile for flight to <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.Arrival_City__c}</span> on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}. Seating allocation for our flights is open on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en.html" target="_blank">qantas.com</a>&nbsp;from 350 days prior to each flight departure. If you have not selected a particular seat prior to check-in, our check-in system will offer you the best match to your preference available at that time. However, as most customers have already chosen their seat by this time, seating options may be limited. To avoid this occurring in future, you may wish to select a seat at the time of booking or prior to check-in opening.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">We are always looking at ways to develop our seating allocation process, and feedback like yours plays an important role in driving improvements. We would like to assure you that your comments have been forwarded to our Airport Management team as part of this development process.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Thank you for taking the time to contact us and we hope that we can make you more comfortable next time you travel.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>